  "description": "#248 (acceptance, hypothesis H2): after a scroll, Up moves the row first, so the list plan back up holds. Load harness/saves/disc1-md1stin-materia-plan.json (Cloud alone, materia slots empty, materia 49 in inventory slots 2, 7 and 13 only, AP = slot), open the field menu, plan the main-menu cursor 0 to 2 (semantic/menu-panel.js), Circle every 60 frames until menu_ovl reads 3 (ovl_wait), 120 frames; the slot column reads 0. Circle (opens the list for the slot under the cursor, #241) and 60 frames; the list row and offset read 0 (#244). Then w_far: materiaListPlan({\"row\":0,\"offset\":0}, 13) from semantic/materia-screen.js, 13 Downs, each a 4-frame press, a wait of at most 30 frames for the cursor that should move (the row, or the offset on a scroll) and a one-frame check of the other, 8 frames between presses; it should end on row 9, offset 4. Then 10 frames and w_back: materiaListPlan({\"button\":\"down\",\"mask\":32,\"expect\":13,\"row\":9,\"offset\":4}, 7) from semantic/materia-screen.js, 6 Ups, each a 4-frame press, a wait of at most 30 frames for the cursor that should move (the row, or the offset on a scroll) and a one-frame check of the other, 8 frames between presses; it should end on row 3, offset 4 (under H2 the offset stays 4; if Up scrolled first, the first row wait fails). Then mark, Circle, and wait until inventory slot 7 reads empty (eq_wait). Checks: slot 7 empty and changed since the mark, slots 2 and 13 unchanged, Cloud's weapon slot 0 holds slot 7's word 0x731, still on overlay 3 in the menu, a rerun matches. Reports the raw list row and offset at the end. Only frame counts, 1/0, indices and author-chosen words leave.",
